# The MAST_common sibling clone, which developers commonly place here even though it is
# reached through the venv's mast.pth (#94 retired the submodule). Untracked and
# unignored, a stray `git add -A src` captures it as a 160000 gitlink and silently
# re-creates the submodule that was deliberately removed. Ignoring it makes that
# impossible rather than merely discouraged.
/src/common/
